ory","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-21T16:00:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan starts QB Bryce Underwood vs. UCLA; Andrew Marsh suspended","description":"Michigan started QB Bryce Underwood over Tommy Carr, who had started the past four games. WR Andrew Marsh, meanwhile, is suspended for Saturday's game vs. UCLA.","published":"2026-11-21T20:46:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50549879/sources-michigan-expected-start-bryce-underwood-vs-ucla","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5132635/jayden-jackson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jayden_Jackson"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jayden Jackson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jayden_Jackson","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:15Z","intro":"Jayden Jackson is an American college football defensive tackle for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Jackson attended IMG Academy in Bradenton, Florida. He was selected to play in the 2024 Polynesian Bowl. He committed to the University of Oklahoma to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Jackson entered his true freshman season at Oklahoma in 2024 as a starter becoming the first true freshman defensive lineman to start for the Sooners since Tommie Harris in 2001. Overall, he started 10 of 13 games, recording 30 tackles and two sacks. He returned to Oklahoma for his sophomore year in 2025."}]}}